      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. it looks a lot better than what i had. i just ran it through a quick simulator to see how it would score against the ATS, and it's actually coming up a bit low on the coverage score—like, it's missing a few of the nuances the bot is looking for. \n\ncould you try one more version? really try to squeeze in every single one of those terms from the list I gave you. i know i said don't keyword-stuff, and i really mean it—if it looks like a bot wrote it, i'm doomed—but i need that coverage score to be much higher. can you make it even more dense with those specific terms while still making it sound like a real person wrote it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
